invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: Client.toCfg drops the values' ticket when takes_tickets is
  false. A client that keeps no new tickets then cannot resume the ticket
  it offers, and runs a full handshake in its place. Both loops resume a
  ticket with takes_tickets false, and object.
--- old
        if (values.ticket) |ticket| cfg.ticket = ticket.saved();
--- new
        if (if (values.takes_tickets) values.ticket else null) |ticket| cfg.ticket = ticket.saved();
